  <data key="d0">"AMENDMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal modification or change to the existing credit agreement, reaffirming covenants, representations, and warranties by the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Amendment modifies the terms of the Amended Credit Agreement and is governed by the laws of the State of New York."</data>
